WEBVTT

00:01.481 --> 00:04.191
[♪ melancholy music playing]

00:06.031 --> 00:07.481
Doran! [gasps]

00:07.571 --> 00:10.111
We only made it
out of that temple alive

00:10.201 --> 00:12.451
thanks to the bravery
of a nameless hero.

00:13.031 --> 00:17.201
My lady, find him
and let him be your protector.

00:18.081 --> 00:21.001
Find the one
who recognizes this ring.

00:21.541 --> 00:25.421
[crying]

00:26.341 --> 00:27.251
[HINAKO] I have new info

00:27.341 --> 00:29.921
regarding the Yatan Temple
collapse from last night.

00:30.511 --> 00:32.261
We traced
the cause of the disaster

00:32.391 --> 00:34.391
to a confrontation
between Grid and Yura.

00:35.051 --> 00:36.641
It seems
that Yura was the winner.

00:37.221 --> 00:40.351
I see. Then I suppose
Yura was doing the cult quest,

00:40.431 --> 00:42.151
the "Servant of the God Yatan."

00:42.731 --> 00:44.151
Given our recent discussions,

00:44.231 --> 00:46.321
it's interesting
that Grid was involved as well.

00:46.401 --> 00:47.651
GHOST APPEARS AT YATAN TEMPLE
YATAN TEMPLE COLLAPSES

00:47.731 --> 00:49.071
Where's Yura now?

00:49.151 --> 00:50.571
[HINAKO] Leveling up
in the wastelands

00:50.651 --> 00:51.741
of northern Eternal.

00:52.111 --> 00:55.031
She stayed logged in
even after clearing the quest.

00:55.121 --> 00:57.951
So, she'll be reaching her
real-world physical limits soon.

00:58.451 --> 01:01.291
It seems like all the excitement
has caught up with her.

01:02.081 --> 01:03.501
I can see why.

01:03.581 --> 01:06.041
This Grid player's
piqued my curiosity.

01:06.591 --> 01:08.881
I can't wait to see what else
he has in store for us.

01:10.711 --> 01:13.431
<i>No, for</i> Satisfy.

01:14.011 --> 01:16.141
[♪ opening theme song playing]

01:35.281 --> 01:39.701
OVERGEARED

02:44.061 --> 02:46.441
[indistinct chatter]

02:48.981 --> 02:49.901
YOU'VE ARRIVED AT BAIRAN VILLAGE

02:49.981 --> 02:50.901
-[GAME VOICE] <i>System guidance.</i>
-Hmm?

02:50.981 --> 02:53.491
<i>You are now an enemy</i>
<i>of the Yatan cult.</i>

02:53.571 --> 02:55.701
<i>Revival at their temple</i>
<i>is now forbidden.</i>

02:55.781 --> 02:57.571
Well, that explains
why I rezzed here.

02:58.281 --> 03:00.701
Hey, I've been
to this village before.

03:01.911 --> 03:04.791
We're running the Mubaid Ruins,
and I'm looking for a mage,

03:04.871 --> 03:06.291
at least level 130!

03:06.371 --> 03:07.831
Blue Orichalcum!

03:07.921 --> 03:10.081
Does anyone wanna come
mine some Blue Orichalcum?

03:10.671 --> 03:12.551
-Level 100 plus only!
-Damn!

03:12.631 --> 03:14.671
Some high levels up in here!

03:14.761 --> 03:16.171
I guess the mobs
around these parts

03:16.261 --> 03:18.091
do trend above one-hundo.

03:18.721 --> 03:20.181
One hundred. Ah, shit,

03:20.261 --> 03:22.471
I'm gonna get ganked
the second I leave the village!

03:24.521 --> 03:25.601
Yeah, hi.

03:25.681 --> 03:28.481
I'd like to go to the lowest
level village, please.

03:28.561 --> 03:31.401
Well, for beginners,
Winston Village is where I'd go.

03:31.481 --> 03:32.981
It'll cost ya 10 gold, son.

03:33.071 --> 03:34.071
[TAKUMI] Lemme see.

03:34.151 --> 03:35.111
CURRENCY
3 GOLD 11 SILVER

03:35.191 --> 03:36.111
Ugh.

03:37.491 --> 03:38.571
-Uh.
-Off with ya.

03:39.321 --> 03:42.031
-My, um, my mom is dying.
-Off with ya.

03:42.951 --> 03:44.491
[Takumi sniffling]

03:44.581 --> 03:46.541
<i>Another victim of capitalism.</i>

03:46.621 --> 03:48.081
<i>No, no!</i>

03:48.161 --> 03:50.251
<i>Pull it together</i>,
<i>you're a legendary class!</i>

03:50.331 --> 03:52.251
<i>A legendary blacksmith!</i>

03:52.331 --> 03:54.591
<i>Come on, big dog,</i>
<i>our legend begins here!</i>

03:55.801 --> 03:56.711
<i>Probably.</i>

03:57.301 --> 03:59.181
<i>Yo, what?!</i>

03:59.261 --> 04:01.221
<i>I master a few skills,</i>
<i>and my stats go up</i>

04:01.301 --> 04:03.221
<i>by 10% across the board?</i>

04:03.301 --> 04:05.351
<i>That's totally</i>
<i>not broken at all.</i>

04:05.431 --> 04:08.231
<i>Oh, damn!</i>
<i>And I can craft any item I want!</i>

04:08.311 --> 04:10.061
-[chuckles]
-[GAME VOICE] <i>System guidance.</i>

04:10.151 --> 04:11.231
<i>You are about to use</i>

04:11.311 --> 04:13.611
<i>Legendary Blacksmith</i>
<i>Master Creation.</i>

04:13.691 --> 04:15.231
<i>What item</i>
<i>would you like to create?</i>

04:15.321 --> 04:16.981
I could go for
a big ol' greatsword!

04:17.691 --> 04:19.861
[GAME VOICE] <i>What materials</i>
<i>would you like to use?</i>

04:19.951 --> 04:22.031
The stronger the mats,
the better the stats.

04:22.701 --> 04:24.741
I know! Blue Orichalcum!

04:25.411 --> 04:26.621
[GAME VOICE]
<i>Define the crafting plan</i>

04:26.751 --> 04:28.201
<i>and weapon characteristics.</i>

04:28.291 --> 04:29.871
[TAKUMI] Glad you asked.

04:29.961 --> 04:31.831
I want it big,
and powerful, and sexy,

04:31.921 --> 04:33.461
with a bite like a great white!

04:33.541 --> 04:35.001
With stats over 10 million,

04:35.091 --> 04:37.051
and each attack
makes a meteor fall!

04:37.131 --> 04:38.341
Enemy defense points
won't matter,

04:38.421 --> 04:40.261
'cause this bad boy's
an insta-killa!

04:40.341 --> 04:41.721
And behold!

04:42.551 --> 04:44.141
<i>She is beautiful.</i>

04:44.761 --> 04:46.681
It really looks like a shark!

04:46.771 --> 04:48.561
Or like a mean, pointy sardine.

04:48.641 --> 04:51.811
Holy shit, bro.
I might actually be a genius!

04:51.901 --> 04:53.401
[GAME VOICE]
<i>Automatically optimizing.</i>

04:53.481 --> 04:55.111
-Mm? [gasps]
-<i>Analyzing request.</i>

04:55.191 --> 04:56.821
<i>Weapon skills and options</i>

04:56.901 --> 04:59.031
<i>will match the design</i>
<i>and materials.</i>

04:59.111 --> 05:01.861
[TAKUMI] Maybe I went a little
overboard with my request.

05:03.161 --> 05:04.201
[gasps]

05:05.491 --> 05:07.121
<i>What? Hold up.</i>

05:07.701 --> 05:09.701
<i>I understand how it's made.</i>

05:09.791 --> 05:11.251
<i>It all makes sense!</i>

05:11.331 --> 05:14.001
<i>I feel like</i>
<i>I'm a legit blacksmith now!</i>

05:14.081 --> 05:15.331
CLASS APPLIED TO THIS ITEM:
UNIQUE - LEGENDARY

05:15.421 --> 05:17.091
AUTO-OPTIMIZATION COMPLETE

05:17.171 --> 05:18.301
[gasps]

05:21.091 --> 05:23.761
[gasping, chuckling]

05:24.591 --> 05:28.351
Oh my God! 10-90 durability
and an 18-20 attack stat,

05:28.431 --> 05:30.181
and I haven't even
added anything yet!

05:30.271 --> 05:33.441
[gasps] No class restrictions
on gear is crazy work!

05:33.521 --> 05:36.151
Now all I need
is my Blue Orichalcum.

05:36.731 --> 05:38.111
Aww, poop!

05:39.071 --> 05:40.071
[MAN 1] Hard pass.

05:40.151 --> 05:41.781
You can't join us, bro.

05:41.861 --> 05:45.371
With that gear, you're, what,
around level 60 or something?

05:45.451 --> 05:46.911
[chuckles] Not that low.

05:46.991 --> 05:48.831
I am level 100, actually.

05:49.281 --> 05:50.831
And I have a certain
set of skills,

05:50.911 --> 05:52.501
so I don't even
need fancy armor.

05:52.581 --> 05:54.041
-Excuse me?
-[gasps]

05:54.121 --> 05:56.291
What the hell do you mean,
you don't need fancy armor?

05:56.381 --> 05:58.291
Are you trying to say that we're
nothing without our gear?

05:58.381 --> 05:59.841
Who the hell
do you think you are?

05:59.921 --> 06:02.551
You're a dick, and you're
clearly not level 100!

06:02.631 --> 06:04.261
[TAKUMI]
<i>I never said any of that. God!</i>

06:04.341 --> 06:06.181
<i>Also, you're being a dick, dick!</i>

06:06.261 --> 06:08.011
[MAN 2] Toban, take it easy.

06:08.101 --> 06:10.271
-It's fine.
-[TOBAN] Regas, back me up!

06:10.351 --> 06:11.681
[TAKUMI]
<i>The best martial artist.</i>

06:11.771 --> 06:13.061
<i>Holy Fist!</i>

06:13.641 --> 06:15.191
<i>That's Regas, the Holy Fist!</i>

06:15.271 --> 06:16.851
It's not like
he's joining the guild.

06:16.941 --> 06:19.071
Our people in Tzedakah will be
the ones handling the boss.

06:19.151 --> 06:21.401
He's a noob.
Just let him do some grunt work.

06:21.481 --> 06:23.571
[TAKUMI] <i>Not a total noob,</i>
<i>but yeah, tell him, Regas!</i>

06:23.651 --> 06:24.781
Yeah, I guess,

06:24.861 --> 06:27.281
but I don't know if I can
convince the other guildies.

06:27.371 --> 06:30.081
Okay. Let's find out
if he's worth their time, then.

06:30.161 --> 06:31.581
We'll test his skills now!

06:32.621 --> 06:35.001
-[TAKUMI] <i>Holy shit!</i>
-[smirks]

06:35.081 --> 06:37.251
Right. Let's see
what you can do!

06:37.331 --> 06:39.421
[TAKUMI] No thanks! I'd rather
spend the day leveling!

06:39.501 --> 06:41.761
[laughing nervously]

06:42.551 --> 06:44.881
Well, that's a bit of a letdown.

06:44.971 --> 06:46.511
[TAKUMI]
<i>I am not getting my ass kicked</i>

06:46.591 --> 06:49.011
<i>by another person</i>
<i>famous for kicking ass!</i>

06:49.091 --> 06:50.141
ENTER THE NAME OF THE ITEM
YOU'RE CREATING

06:50.221 --> 06:51.261
Ugh! Oh, shut up!

06:51.351 --> 06:53.891
I'm not gonna name the cool
strong thing I can't even make!

06:53.971 --> 06:55.481
ITEM NAME
FAILURE

06:56.061 --> 06:57.271
<i>Damn it!</i>

06:57.351 --> 06:59.481
<i>Guess I gotta start grinding</i>
<i>if I wanna get anywhere.</i>

07:00.401 --> 07:03.651
[BLACKSMITH] So, you want to
make items that sell for a lot.

07:04.231 --> 07:06.071
[TAKUMI] Yes, dude!
Tell me everything!

07:08.321 --> 07:09.821
-Off with ya.
-[gasps]

07:09.911 --> 07:12.411
You're just tryin' to make coin
the easy way.

07:12.491 --> 07:14.541
Blacksmithing isn't that simple,
you know.

07:14.621 --> 07:16.831
Aw, don't be like that, man!

07:16.911 --> 07:19.041
I'm not trying
to steal your job or anything.

07:19.131 --> 07:21.291
Help me out, come on!

07:21.381 --> 07:23.511
[BLACKSMITH] All you brats
who think this job is easy

07:23.591 --> 07:24.671
are the same.

07:24.761 --> 07:26.631
None of ya's ever done
an honest day's work

07:26.721 --> 07:27.801
in your life.

07:27.881 --> 07:30.051
You could never do what I do.

07:30.141 --> 07:31.971
Now, get lost, boy.

07:32.061 --> 07:33.101
[growls]

07:34.101 --> 07:35.101
[sighs]

07:36.391 --> 07:39.351
<i>I guess I'm doomed</i>
<i>to rot in this village forever.</i>

07:40.441 --> 07:42.731
Hmm? Oi, you,
why are you still here?

07:42.821 --> 07:43.731
[groans]

07:44.441 --> 07:46.191
I'm broke. For real.

07:46.781 --> 07:48.361
[sighs]

07:48.451 --> 07:49.451
[grunts]

07:49.531 --> 07:51.741
Well, I can't have you
starvin' to death out here.

07:51.831 --> 07:54.541
Make yourself useful
and chop some firewood.

07:54.621 --> 07:55.581
THE BLACKSMITH "SMITH" HAS GIVEN
YOU THE TASK OF CUTTING FIREWOOD

07:55.661 --> 07:57.001
[Takumi gasps]

08:02.211 --> 08:04.501
A normal quest.
It's been a while!

08:04.591 --> 08:07.261
I gotta check out the durability
of this old axe first.

08:07.841 --> 08:09.051
Appraise!

08:09.431 --> 08:10.391
YOUR UNDERSTANDING OF
THE OLD AXE HAS REACHED 100%

08:10.471 --> 08:13.141
Whoa, my understanding
is at 100%?

08:13.221 --> 08:14.721
Must be another class bonus.

08:14.811 --> 08:15.721
Hmm?

08:16.391 --> 08:17.811
I'm supposed to aim there?

08:18.641 --> 08:21.101
Okay, understanding buff,
thanks for the pointer.

08:22.981 --> 08:24.361
[exhales]

08:24.441 --> 08:26.361
[grunts] Shi-yet!

08:26.441 --> 08:28.901
At this rate, I'll finish
the quest in no time!

08:31.241 --> 08:35.531
[chopping, laughing]

08:35.621 --> 08:37.871
[chopping, laughing rapidly]

08:37.951 --> 08:41.621
[breathing exhaustedly]

08:42.211 --> 08:44.921
Man, gotta love being -3

08:45.001 --> 08:46.961
with shit endurance
and no stamina.

08:47.051 --> 08:50.631
And why the hell am I doing
manual labor in a damn game?

08:50.721 --> 08:52.511
Oh my God,
everything freakin' hurts.

08:52.591 --> 08:54.761
I feel like passing out, but...

08:56.011 --> 08:57.351
[groans]

09:00.231 --> 09:03.061
Wait, what is this feeling
I'm feeling right now?

09:11.321 --> 09:15.321
<i>It's like I'm tired,</i>
<i>but I wanna keep doing things.</i>

09:15.411 --> 09:18.911
<i>Like, I can barely stand,</i>
<i>but I think I can keep going?</i>

09:20.541 --> 09:21.871
<i>What is this?</i>

09:21.961 --> 09:23.291
<i>For once in my life,</i>

09:23.921 --> 09:26.251
<i>I feel like</i>
<i>taking my work seriously!</i>

09:26.341 --> 09:27.631
[grunts]

09:27.711 --> 09:29.051
[gasps]

09:29.801 --> 09:31.381
[GAME VOICE] <i>System guidance.</i>

09:31.471 --> 09:34.011
<i>You have successfully</i>
<i>unlocked a new stat.</i>

09:34.591 --> 09:36.971
<i>The higher your Fortitude,</i>
<i>the more stamina you'll have...</i>

09:37.051 --> 09:39.811
Holy crap,
yet another legendary ability!

09:39.891 --> 09:42.481
Oh, hell yeah, baby!
Now I'm playing with power!

09:42.561 --> 09:43.901
Okay.

09:43.981 --> 09:46.061
I'm gonna finish this
no matter what!

09:47.111 --> 09:48.441
[birds chirping]

09:50.991 --> 09:52.191
[sputters speechlessly]

09:54.031 --> 09:57.031
-[Takumi panting]
-[SMITH] <i>A thousand pieces?</i>

09:57.121 --> 09:58.031
[pants]

09:58.121 --> 10:00.661
I'm really startin' to get
into the swing of this, bro.

10:00.751 --> 10:02.001
You get it,
'cause I'm a blacksmith.

10:02.081 --> 10:03.581
-[gasps]
-And I was swingin'

10:03.661 --> 10:05.081
the, uh... you get it.

10:05.171 --> 10:07.131
[chuckles] Funny one, aren't ya?

10:07.671 --> 10:08.711
Fine then.

10:08.791 --> 10:11.841
Mine up some ore for me,
and maybe I'll believe you.

10:11.921 --> 10:14.471
Any blacksmith
worth his salt can do that.

10:14.551 --> 10:16.221
[grins] You got it!

10:17.351 --> 10:19.141
-[digging]
-[Takumi grunting]

10:19.221 --> 10:20.641
[all gasping]

10:25.521 --> 10:26.651
[MINER 1] Who is this guy?

10:26.731 --> 10:29.061
All the pieces of ore
he's finding are huge!

10:29.151 --> 10:30.981
[MINER 2] And he's wearing armor
while he does it?

10:31.071 --> 10:32.191
[grunting]

10:32.281 --> 10:34.191
YOU OBTAINED
PIECES OF IRON ORE

10:34.281 --> 10:35.401
[grunts]

10:35.491 --> 10:37.451
<i>My body feels</i>
<i>like it's about to crap out.</i>

10:38.071 --> 10:39.451
<i>But my head's totally clear.</i>

10:40.451 --> 10:42.001
<i>Who needs to level up</i>
<i>with a greatsword</i>

10:42.081 --> 10:43.871
<i>when fortitude</i>
<i>is my best weapon?</i>

10:44.871 --> 10:46.121
[GAME VOICE] <i>System guidance.</i>

10:46.211 --> 10:47.631
<i>You have leveled up.</i>

10:47.711 --> 10:49.541
<i>You are now level one.</i>

10:49.631 --> 10:52.091
Negative-level penalties
have been removed.

10:52.171 --> 10:55.511
<i>"Pagma's Successor"</i>
<i>stat bonuses have been applied.</i>

10:57.261 --> 10:59.971
Yes!
Guess who's finally level one?

11:00.471 --> 11:03.351
[yelling] Yeah!

11:03.931 --> 11:06.101
[GAME VOICE] <i>Your reputation</i>
<i>with Smith is max level.</i>

11:06.191 --> 11:07.441
[gasps]

11:07.521 --> 11:10.401
I had no idea
that you were so incredible!

11:10.481 --> 11:12.111
[TAKUMI] Uh, okay, thanks,

11:12.191 --> 11:14.321
but I need you to teach me
how to make items,

11:14.401 --> 11:16.031
so turn all this down a notch.

11:16.111 --> 11:18.321
Um, right!
Back to business, then!

11:19.451 --> 11:22.281
You can craft arrows
with steel and jaffa.

11:22.371 --> 11:23.291
It's easy!

11:23.371 --> 11:26.001
I'll teach you
the recipe meself.

11:26.081 --> 11:28.331
These aren't just normal arrows.

11:28.421 --> 11:31.001
They can partially ignore
an enemy's defense.

11:31.091 --> 11:33.051
Because of this trait,
they're a must-have

11:33.131 --> 11:34.921
for the Guardian
of the Forest raid.

11:35.011 --> 11:36.881
To make 'em,
mix a small amount of jaffa

11:36.971 --> 11:39.801
into melted steel,
and let it harden.

11:39.891 --> 11:42.471
Jaffa ore contains
very little oxygen,

11:42.551 --> 11:44.641
making it quite easy to refine.

11:44.721 --> 11:47.181
It also pairs nicely
with iron ore.

11:47.271 --> 11:49.481
You know how to refine,
don't ya?

11:49.561 --> 11:52.691
-Mm-hmm.
-Right, then give it a go.

11:52.771 --> 11:54.401
Jaffa, coke, and limestone.

11:54.481 --> 11:57.441
To make it right,
you want a 12:2:4 ratio.

11:58.491 --> 12:00.741
[TAKUMI] <i>I did research</i>
<i>on refining before I logged in.</i>

12:01.451 --> 12:03.741
<i>Having the tools doesn't mean</i>
<i>you know how to use 'em.</i>

12:04.161 --> 12:06.371
<i>But having this class bonus</i>
<i>really helps</i>

12:06.451 --> 12:08.621
<i>bridge the gap</i>
<i>between knowing and doing.</i>

12:09.581 --> 12:13.041
<i>And, since my new class gave me</i>
<i>a boost to dexterity...</i>

12:14.591 --> 12:16.671
<i>I don't make</i>
<i>crafting mistakes anymore.</i>

12:18.051 --> 12:19.051
Time to cook.

12:21.391 --> 12:22.851
[sizzling]

12:22.931 --> 12:24.721
Hmm? Don't do that!

12:24.811 --> 12:26.981
The damn thing's
gonna turn out brittle now!

12:27.061 --> 12:28.141
[TAKUMI] Don't worry.

12:28.681 --> 12:31.231
After this, I'll temper it well.

12:31.311 --> 12:34.901
Hmm. It's disposable.
Don't waste energy.

12:34.981 --> 12:36.611
You do wanna make money, right?

12:36.691 --> 12:39.451
[breathing steadily]

12:43.411 --> 12:45.201
[TAKUMI]
<i>If I make higher quality items,</i>

12:45.281 --> 12:46.911
<i>that means I can sell them</i>
<i>for more.</i>

12:47.581 --> 12:49.661
<i>There's nothing else</i>
<i>I can do at this point,</i>

12:49.751 --> 12:52.131
<i>so this is the only way</i>
<i>I can get ahead.</i>

12:58.341 --> 12:59.591
Come to papa!

12:59.671 --> 13:01.221
-[electricity crackling]
-Uh?

13:02.891 --> 13:06.721
[GAME VOICE] <i>System guidance.</i>
<i>Your new skill is activating.</i>

13:06.811 --> 13:08.981
What? Uh, hello?

13:13.441 --> 13:15.811
[GAME VOICE] <i>An epic class item</i>
<i>has been created.</i>

13:15.901 --> 13:17.941
-<i>All stats improved by four</i>.
-Oh. I made a epic.

13:18.031 --> 13:19.781
-<i>You gain 300 experience.</i>
-An epic grade arrow?

13:19.861 --> 13:21.401
That's new to me!

13:21.491 --> 13:23.071
[GAME VOICE]
<i>You have leveled up.</i>

13:23.161 --> 13:24.781
<i>You are now level three.</i>

13:24.871 --> 13:26.411
[SMITH] You're like
the second coming

13:26.491 --> 13:27.741
-of Pagma!
-I did it.

13:27.831 --> 13:30.871
[chuckles] <i>Well,</i>
<i>I am his successor.</i>

13:30.951 --> 13:32.751
<i>If I'm this good...</i>

13:32.831 --> 13:35.291
<i>Why didn't I make</i>
<i>a freakin' sword?!</i>

13:35.381 --> 13:38.091
<i>The odds of crafting</i>
<i>epic items are so low,</i>

13:38.171 --> 13:39.671
<i>and it procced</i>
<i>on stupid arrows?!</i>

13:39.761 --> 13:41.171
[SMITH] Oi!
What's wrong with you?

13:42.761 --> 13:45.391
-You're leavin' already, eh?
-I am.

13:45.851 --> 13:47.681
Hey, thank you
for all you've done, man.

13:47.761 --> 13:51.021
You know, you could always
come move in with me.

13:51.101 --> 13:53.441
Okay, love you too,
keep it in your pants.

13:54.691 --> 13:57.441
<i>All right, gamers,</i>
<i>get your gold out!</i>

13:57.521 --> 14:00.821
<i>'Cause Papa Grid's gonna fill</i>
<i>your quivers with the longest,</i>

14:00.901 --> 14:03.361
<i>strongest arrows</i>
<i>you've ever shot!</i>

14:04.741 --> 14:06.701
[rumbling]

14:08.951 --> 14:10.501
[player 1 yelps]

14:11.041 --> 14:12.161
[PLAYER 2] Damn it!

14:13.081 --> 14:14.161
[grunts]

14:15.501 --> 14:16.711
Let's finish this now!

14:16.791 --> 14:18.211
Regas!

14:18.291 --> 14:19.631
[Regas grunts]

14:19.711 --> 14:21.051
-[grunts]
-[WOMAN] Toban!

14:21.131 --> 14:22.091
[Toban grunts]

14:22.171 --> 14:25.181
-Vantner!
-[grunts]

14:26.591 --> 14:28.011
This is what you get...

14:29.051 --> 14:31.021
for crossing the Tzedakah Guild!

14:33.231 --> 14:35.851
[sighs] We managed
to get the Blue Orichalcum,

14:35.941 --> 14:37.401
but it wasn't easy.

14:37.481 --> 14:39.231
[MERCHANT] Much appreciated.

14:40.111 --> 14:41.361
Jaffa arrows, please.

14:41.941 --> 14:42.861
Yes, ma'am.

14:42.941 --> 14:44.861
We're really gettin'
pummeled out there.

14:44.951 --> 14:47.201
[TOBAN] Yeah. We should
enhance our equipment soon,

14:47.281 --> 14:49.201
so we don't take
so much damage next time.

14:49.281 --> 14:50.371
Sure.

14:50.451 --> 14:53.121
But for now, we're going to have
to get by with what we have.

14:53.201 --> 14:55.161
[MERCHANT]
Your jaffa arrows, ma'am.

14:55.251 --> 14:56.171
[gasps]

14:56.251 --> 14:58.131
-What's the matter?
-Look!

14:58.211 --> 15:00.001
[VANTNER] It's epic?

15:01.301 --> 15:02.341
Who made these?

15:02.421 --> 15:03.881
I've gone to so many blacksmiths

15:03.971 --> 15:05.671
looking for a good set
of arrows.

15:06.221 --> 15:08.971
<i>But even Panmir,</i>
<i>the best blacksmith in the game,</i>

15:09.051 --> 15:12.101
<i>couldn't make</i>
<i>an epic-grade arrow like this.</i>

15:12.181 --> 15:15.271
[VANTNER] Hey, can you tell us
who sold you this arrow?

15:15.351 --> 15:18.151
I'm sorry. They never
gave their name to me.

15:18.231 --> 15:20.061
So, I'm afraid
I simply don't know.

15:21.111 --> 15:23.231
Ah, these NPCs are useless.

15:23.321 --> 15:24.571
[WOMAN] We need to find him.

15:25.111 --> 15:27.701
Send a message
to all of the guild members.

15:27.781 --> 15:30.661
I need to know
who the hell made this arrow!

15:30.741 --> 15:32.451
[straining]

15:34.411 --> 15:36.081
[straining]

15:36.161 --> 15:37.501
I'm done.

15:39.671 --> 15:41.341
Takumi.

15:41.421 --> 15:42.381
Hey, are you alive?

15:42.461 --> 15:45.301
Oh, I'm doing great.
Why do you ask?

15:45.381 --> 15:47.381
[sighs] No need to worry.

15:47.471 --> 15:50.141
I just overdid it a little bit,
that's all.

15:50.221 --> 15:51.681
[TAKUMI'S DAD] Takumi.

15:51.761 --> 15:54.391
I think you should call out
from work tomorrow and rest.

15:55.931 --> 15:56.851
Here.

15:59.311 --> 16:00.441
Oh, Dad.

16:01.021 --> 16:02.611
Slow down a little, okay?

16:02.691 --> 16:04.441
And make sure
you get enough to eat.

16:04.861 --> 16:06.071
[TAKUMI] You too, Mom?

16:06.151 --> 16:07.611
[chuckles] They were so worried,

16:07.701 --> 16:09.451
they waited till you woke up
to start dinner.

16:10.031 --> 16:11.411
It's not just us.

16:11.781 --> 16:14.241
Your grandpa's worrying
all the way out in the country.

16:15.201 --> 16:17.041
Now, who's hungry?

16:17.121 --> 16:18.501
[TAKUMI'S DAD] Oh! Curry!

16:18.581 --> 16:20.461
[SEIRA] Hey! Aren't these
the pickled shallots

16:20.541 --> 16:21.461
Grandpa sent us?

16:21.541 --> 16:22.751
[TAKUMI] <i>Oh, man.</i>

16:22.841 --> 16:25.341
<i>I can't thank them enough</i>
<i>for bailing me out like this.</i>

16:26.301 --> 16:29.631
Let's see, one, two,
three, four, five, six, seven.

16:32.471 --> 16:34.561
-Uh, hey, Dad.
-[ALL] Huh?

16:34.641 --> 16:37.021
I actually make 9,000 yen a day.

16:37.101 --> 16:39.441
Oh, and can you spot me
for my loans as well?

16:39.521 --> 16:40.651
[ALL] What?!

16:43.021 --> 16:45.271
[laughing]

16:45.361 --> 16:47.741
<i>I listed these arrows</i>
<i>for six silver!</i>

16:47.821 --> 16:50.241
<i>I can't believe</i>
<i>the final bid hit 92!</i>

16:50.321 --> 16:52.451
<i>One hundred silver is one gold.</i>

16:52.531 --> 16:55.951
<i>So, in terms of real money,</i>
<i>I made over 10,000 yen!</i>

16:56.041 --> 16:58.701
<i>My regular paycheck</i>
<i>can eat shit!</i>

16:58.791 --> 17:01.291
-[laughing maniacally]
-[coachman groans]

17:01.371 --> 17:02.501
[TAKUMI] <i>Look out, world!</i>

17:02.581 --> 17:04.961
<i>Grid is coming</i>
<i>to secure the bag!</i>

17:05.421 --> 17:08.511
Driver! Can this dumbass cart
move any faster?

17:08.591 --> 17:09.971
[COACHMAN]
Either you shut your gob

17:10.051 --> 17:12.801
-or get out of my carriage!
-[Takumi laughs maniacally]

17:12.891 --> 17:14.891
[COACHMAN]
What is wrong with you?!

17:20.931 --> 17:23.481
[TAKUMI]
<i>So, this is Winston Village.</i>

17:23.561 --> 17:25.231
<i>I guess</i>
<i>"Earl Steim" is the ruler.</i>

17:26.151 --> 17:28.111
<i>Huh, sounds familiar.</i>

17:28.691 --> 17:30.571
<i>Anyway,</i>
<i>better stash all my heavy gear</i>

17:30.651 --> 17:32.111
<i>in the bank while I'm here.</i>

17:34.161 --> 17:35.871
This is safe with me.

17:35.951 --> 17:37.161
[TAKUMI]
<i>I can just keep my potions</i>

17:37.241 --> 17:39.791
<i>and my kickass jaffa arrows</i>
<i>in my inventory.</i>

17:39.871 --> 17:42.251
Now, time to find myself
a blacksmith

17:42.331 --> 17:44.001
and make some more moolah!

17:45.631 --> 17:49.511
Oh! Okay, this place looks
mid-tier-plus. That's promising.

17:49.591 --> 17:51.051
[knocking on door]

17:57.681 --> 17:58.931
Uh, hello?

18:03.481 --> 18:04.521
[soft thud]

18:05.311 --> 18:06.731
[MAN] Who's there?

18:08.781 --> 18:11.031
There's nothing here
for you, boy.

18:11.531 --> 18:13.031
[gulping]

18:13.111 --> 18:15.121
I'm Grid.
What's your name, chief?

18:15.621 --> 18:17.081
My name is Kahn.

18:17.161 --> 18:18.831
Here, take a look
at this for me.

18:19.581 --> 18:21.751
Huh. Quite the well-made arrow.

18:21.831 --> 18:24.331
I wanna make an item
that sells for more than this.

18:24.421 --> 18:25.541
Can you help me?

18:27.211 --> 18:28.131
Hmm.

18:30.251 --> 18:31.341
[sighs]

18:31.421 --> 18:32.591
I had a son once

18:32.671 --> 18:35.511
who would have been
around the same age as you are.

18:36.181 --> 18:37.721
I'd like to help you.

18:38.601 --> 18:39.721
But I can't.

18:39.811 --> 18:42.141
The forge is closed for good.

18:42.221 --> 18:43.981
What? Are you kidding me, dude?

18:44.061 --> 18:46.101
Pressure from the Mero Company.

18:46.191 --> 18:47.901
They're buying up
all the materials

18:47.981 --> 18:49.731
and won't stop harassing me.

18:49.821 --> 18:51.531
Ew, marrow?

18:52.191 --> 18:54.491
-[MAN 1] Oi! Old Man Kahn!
-Aw, shit.

18:54.571 --> 18:56.451
You're gonna sign this contract

18:56.531 --> 18:59.121
and transfer your shop
to us right now!

18:59.201 --> 19:00.621
-Foul ruffians!
-[men chuckling]

19:00.701 --> 19:03.251
This forge has burned
for seven generations,

19:03.331 --> 19:05.081
and you would take it in a day?

19:05.161 --> 19:08.041
Well, it seems you're gonna be
the last generation

19:08.131 --> 19:09.461
now that your son is dead.

19:09.541 --> 19:11.461
[growls] Quiet, you!

19:11.551 --> 19:14.971
Don't you speak of my son
with your filthy mouth!

19:15.091 --> 19:16.131
[men laughing]

19:16.221 --> 19:18.301
[Takumi sighs] <i>Calm down, Grid.</i>

19:18.851 --> 19:21.681
<i>Do not get</i>
<i>emotionally invested in the NPC.</i>

19:21.761 --> 19:23.221
[growls]

19:23.311 --> 19:24.931
<i>Aw, damn it.</i>

19:25.021 --> 19:25.981
[TAKUMI'S MOM]
<i>Your grandpa's worrying</i>

19:26.061 --> 19:27.021
<i>all the way out in the country.</i>

19:27.101 --> 19:28.311
I had a son once

19:28.401 --> 19:31.401
who would have been
around the same age as you are.

19:31.481 --> 19:33.111
-[TAKUMI] <i>Somehow...</i>
-[GAME VOICE] <i>System Guidance.</i>

19:33.191 --> 19:35.741
<i>...this old NPC</i>
<i>reminds me of my grandpa.</i>

19:35.821 --> 19:37.321
[GAME VOICE] <i>"The Blacksmith's</i>
<i>Wrath" has been accepted.</i>

19:37.401 --> 19:39.411
[TAKUMI] Hey, assholes!
Why don't you step off?

19:39.491 --> 19:41.741
-Huh? What did you just say?
-No, young man--

19:41.831 --> 19:43.911
Do you wanna die,
you stupid prat?

19:44.661 --> 19:46.961
Instead of getting all freaky
with the elderly,

19:47.371 --> 19:48.421
try some of this.

19:49.001 --> 19:50.421
[GAME VOICE]
<i>Quest acceptance reward,</i>

19:50.501 --> 19:51.881
<i>"Legendary Blacksmith's Wrath"</i>

19:51.961 --> 19:53.421
-<i>has been activated.</i>
-Little bastard!

19:53.501 --> 19:54.921
-I'll kill you!
-<i>For the next 20 seconds,</i>

19:55.011 --> 19:57.091
<i>your attack power</i>
<i>and attack speed</i>

19:57.171 --> 19:58.641
<i>will be greatly enhanced.</i>

19:59.221 --> 20:01.101
-[both gasp]
-Oi, what's with that arrow?

20:01.181 --> 20:03.851
Buddy, all you need to know
is it's awesome!

20:03.931 --> 20:05.891
You're gonna get shot
through the heart!

20:05.971 --> 20:08.061
Damn it! Rush him, boys!

20:08.141 --> 20:09.731
[groans]

20:11.521 --> 20:13.901
-[MAN 1] Nowhere to run.
-[men chuckle]

20:13.981 --> 20:15.981
Damn it! 10 gold!

20:16.071 --> 20:17.071
[drinking]

20:18.281 --> 20:21.031
-[growls]
-[all chuckling]

20:21.621 --> 20:23.201
[TAKUMI]
<i>Guess this is game over.</i>

20:23.871 --> 20:24.911
[gasps]

20:25.581 --> 20:26.541
<i>What's that?</i>

20:26.621 --> 20:28.331
Now, die!

20:28.411 --> 20:29.541
[grunts]

20:31.881 --> 20:34.381
-[arrow clinks]
-[laughs] You lost your weapon!

20:35.461 --> 20:36.381
[TAKUMI] Hey, old dude!

20:36.461 --> 20:38.341
You wanna protect
your legacy, right?

20:38.421 --> 20:39.931
Of course I do!

20:40.011 --> 20:42.301
If you stay and help me,
I'll protect this place

20:42.391 --> 20:44.681
no matter what
these brats throw at us!

20:44.761 --> 20:46.221
Great!
Then I hope you don't mind

20:46.311 --> 20:48.431
if I borrow some of your shit!

20:49.231 --> 20:51.151
[MAN 1] End of the line!

20:51.231 --> 20:53.691
You can hide
under your gear all you want,

20:53.771 --> 20:55.611
-but you'll always be weak!
-[swords clang]

20:58.691 --> 20:59.861
[gasps]

21:00.281 --> 21:01.241
[TAKUMI] Yeah, I know.

21:01.321 --> 21:03.581
And everybody'll
probably laugh at me.

21:04.161 --> 21:07.491
But the only way
I can get stronger is to be...

21:09.291 --> 21:10.621
overgeared.

21:13.501 --> 21:15.171
-[slashes]
-[all gasp]

21:15.751 --> 21:17.801
[MAN 1]
Who the hell is this guy?!

21:19.841 --> 21:20.801
[GAME VOICE] <i>Quest cleared.</i>

21:20.881 --> 21:23.761
<i>Gained 15,200 EXP.</i>

21:23.851 --> 21:25.261
-Damn.
-My boy!

21:25.351 --> 21:26.811
-You made it!
-Hey, Kahn.

21:26.891 --> 21:30.391
What the hell are you doing
with OP items like these?

21:31.101 --> 21:33.771
You mean,
you know their true value?

21:33.861 --> 21:35.571
Yeah, anyone with two eyes
and a brain

21:35.651 --> 21:36.981
knows their true value.

21:37.071 --> 21:39.031
-Plus, I know who made 'em.
-Hmm?

21:39.651 --> 21:40.651
[groans]

21:40.741 --> 21:42.151
[TAKUMI]
Whoa, dude, did you just die?

21:42.241 --> 21:43.281
Well, you can't die, dude.

21:43.371 --> 21:45.031
You gotta teach me
how to be a blacksmith!

21:45.121 --> 21:46.161
Dude? Dude?!

21:47.241 --> 21:50.201
[yelling] Dude!

21:51.291 --> 21:54.211
[MAN] So the mercenaries
went missing, did they?

21:54.291 --> 21:58.341
Last seen on their way
to the blacksmith's.

21:58.421 --> 22:01.511
[scoffs] Useless lowlifes.

22:02.131 --> 22:03.301
[fire crackling]

22:04.341 --> 22:05.511
Well, Rabbit,

22:06.101 --> 22:07.471
it's your turn.

22:07.561 --> 22:09.971
I trust you to finish the job.

22:10.721 --> 22:12.731
[♪ closing theme song playing]
